  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation Swedish Radio MDO 2023-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbete Sveriges Radio MDO 2023-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att st&#xE4;rka yttrandefriheten i Albanien genom att &#xF6;ka f&#xF6;rtroendet f&#xF6;r Albanska public service/RTSH. Tv&#xE5; viktiga delm&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra RTSH:s f&#xF6;rm&#xE5;ga att vara en p&#xE5;litlig och trov&#xE4;rdig k&#xE4;lla i det digitala medielandskapet, och att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra redaktionens rutiner och kvaliteten p&#xE5; inneh&#xE5;llet i lokala och nationella nyhetsbevakningar. S&#xE4;rskilda delm&#xE5;l g&#xE4;llande j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet, milj&#xF6; och klimat ing&#xE5;r i samarbetet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention&apos;s overall goal is to strengthen freedom of expression in Albania by increasing trust in Public Service Media in Albania/RTSH. Two key outcomes are improving RTSH&#x2019;s capacity to be a reliable and trustworthy public service provider in the digital media landscape and enhancing editorial routines and content quality in local and national news. Specific outputs on gender equality and environment and climate change are included in the cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Overall Objective: The intervention will lead to strengthening of freedom of expression in Albania through higher trust in Public Service Media

Outcome 1: Management and staff have improved capacity to develop RTSH into a reliable and trustworthy public service provider in the digital media landscape

Outcome 2: Editorial routines and the quality of the content in the local and national news are improved</narrative>
  </description>
